<!-- Narrative -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem;">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:1rem;">Overview</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#555;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">The Taikan T-700SE is the workhorse of our heavy-duty three-axis cell. With a generous 700 x 420 x 520 mm travel and a rigid BT40 direct-drive spindle running at 12,000 rpm, it powers through 6061/7075 aluminum plates, carbon steel brackets and stainless fixtures without breaking a sweat.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#555;line-height:1.7;">Multiple units run in our group-run workshop, giving us overflow capacity to scale from 10 prototypes to 10,000 production pieces - all under one roof, with key dimensions verified on our in-house 2.5D vision measuring system before shipment; full CMM verification arranged at our group's shared metrology center on request.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:right;">设备概述</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#555;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;text-align:right;">台群 T-700SE 是我们重型三轴单元的主力机型。700 x 420 x 520 mm 大行程搭配 BT40 12000 转高刚性直联主轴，轻松应对 6061/7075 铝板、碳钢支架和不锈钢夹具的加工需求。</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#555;line-height:1.7;text-align:right;">家族工厂内多台机组并行运行，从 10 件原型到 10000 件量产均可灵活扩产，全程在同一车间内完成，并通过海克斯康 Optiv 2.5D 三次元检测后方可出货。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

